  "add_paragraph": [
    "Emily works on the air the lab's field sites breathe: what is suspended in it, where it came from, and how far it travels before it settles. She runs the aerosol-flux group.",
    "She is building the lab's ==low-cost sensor calibration set== — a reference rig that lets a hundred cheap particulate sensors be trusted against one carefully maintained instrument.",
    "Before joining CLEAR WATER LAB she spent four years on atmospheric measurement campaigns in the Balkans and the High Arctic."
  ],
